 INE: rolling registrations close 27 October 2026 or when the budget runs o
 ut\, so apply early.\n\nOrganisation: Centrul de Proiecte al Municipiului 
 Timisoara\nLocation: Timisoara\, Romania. Mobility must be to or from Timi
 soara\; open to Romanian and foreign nationals aged 18+ active in cultural
  professions.\nAward: Maximum RON 7\,500 per national mobility\; maximum R
 ON 10\,000 per international mobility. Non-reimbursable\, with a required 
 co-funding of at least 1% of the project budget. No application fee.\nDura
 tion: Per mobility\n\nMore: https://centruldeproiecte.ro/finantari/mobilit
 ies-for-cultural-professionals-2026/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk
